<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 72,908 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 72,908 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 72,908 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Tuesday, compared to 84,688 tonnes on in the previous 24 hours.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Monday	   Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			 8,578	    6,931</p>
<p>    Import cargo			64,330	   77,757</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, two ships sailed and two berthed. In the next 24 hours, seven ships were expected to sail and 11 were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
